  "geometry": "All nine simple original bodies retained: seven stands754V/374T, TV41V/21T, crowd4V/2T. No added supports, slats, bolts or individual spectator geometry. Original open cards/backs, silhouettes, positions/normals/UVs/ordered corners/material slots/colours preserved. All512 hierarchy nodes and127 local bindings unchanged.",
